This code will create a form where users can enter their text and submit it via a POST request to `save_text.php`. The `action` attribute specifies the URL to redirect after submission.

To use this form, simply copy the code into an HTML file and add it to your server-side PHP script (`save_text.php`) like so:

```php
<?php
if ($_SERVER['REQUEST_METHOD'] == 'POST') {
    $text = $_POST['text'];
    // Save the text to a file or database here
} else {
    echo "Invalid request.";
}
?>
```

